<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cisco EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it increased its 1998 earnings estimate on Cisco Systems Inc to $2.67 a share from $2.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- said set a 1999 earnings estimate of $3.33 a share.</p>
<p>-- said maintained a buy rating on the stock and the 12-month price target of $95.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Cisco posted fourth quarter of $0.55 a share, which matched the official Wall Street consensus but feel short of some more optimistic expectations.</p>
<p>-- Cisco dropped 1-12/16 to 80-3/16.</p>
</text>
